    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>The parent arcane class; this slice enables the Mage path.</p><ul><li>d6 Hit Die; low base attack; good Will save; 2 + Intellect skill points.</li><li>Intellect-based repertoire casting from a spellbook with shared slots by spell level.</li><li>Mage adds Diplomacy and Sense Motive as class skills.</li></ul>"
    },
    "disabledAbilities": [],
    "epic": "",
    "extraDescription": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Mage path rules</p><ul><li>One path-restricted bonus slot per spell level, +1 save DC for path spells, and +2 Spellcraft to learn them.</li><li>Arcana at path levels 1, 4, 8, 12, and 16.</li><li>Other-path penalties are retained as rules text until more paths are imported.</li></ul>"
    },
